      <profiles>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="3af1-2501-7330-d7b9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lethal Obsession" id="2865-362e-8994-d20e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by a ranged attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; When a Charge is declared:
      -&gt; You can re-roll the Charge roll.
      -&gt; The triggering unit must end its move where the triggering unit is within Engagement Range of the selected unit, during its Charge moves.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Thrill Seekers" id="e044-96c5-5446-30a7" hidden="false" targetId="3e41-919c-e639-f8bf" type="rule"/>
