        <profile name="Leader" id="4927-7428-0067-7e95" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Warped Interference (Psychic)" id="c4b1-18c2-8532-da35" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, while making ranged attacks, the unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Wracking Agonies (Psychic)" id="b0c5-6b25-642b-db75" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy INFANTRY unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by Agonising Energies during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is wracked with agonies.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is wracked with agonies, subtract 2 from that unit's Move characteristic.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is wracked with agonies, that unit gets -2 to Charge rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Thrill Seekers" id="04df-b11b-9a7e-5e35" hidden="false" targetId="3e41-919c-e639-f8bf" type="rule"/>
