        <profile name="Euphoric Strikes" id="b177-022f-d0d9-7b23" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase, you may use this ability, once per battle per unit, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model.
  -&gt; Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="5e55-ee5d-dd06-422a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lord of the Host" id="4908-0c61-68ee-54a5" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When declaring Battle Formations, while this model is attached to a BATTLELINE EMPEROR'S CHILDREN unit:
  -&gt; The unit gains the Infiltrators ability.
  -&gt; The unit gains the Scouts 6" ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Perfectionists" id="774f-ec61-d412-f7dd" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, the unit's weapons gain [LETHAL HITS].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
