      <profiles>
        <profile name="Daemon Prince of Slaanesh" id="6697-7547-5496-db25" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">10"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">60mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="0008-6e71-a188-c518" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Ecstatic Death" id="082b-8e85-19c2-5214" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While making melee attacks, unless this model has fought this phase, destroy this model.
Each time a model in this unit is destroyed, roll one D6. On a 2+, leave that model on the battlefield; after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, it can fight. Remove it after it has fought.
-&gt; After an enemy unit shoots: remove this model from play.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Excessive Vigour (Aura)" id="539b-ec36-89b3-a3af" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly SLAANESH unit is within 6" of this model, if the unit charged this turn, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by that unit by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lord of Excess" id="fb55-b5f2-154e-79fe" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is within 3" of a friendly INFANTRY SLAANESH unit, this model gains the Lone Operative ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
