            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">11</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">16</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">5+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">130mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Daemon Primarch of Slaanesh" id="3e4f-3050-ec28-5a57" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent's Command phase, until the end of the battle round:
  -&gt; At the start of your opponent's Command phase:
    -&gt; Select one:
      - Beguiling Form: each time an attack targets this model, apply -1 to the Hit roll.
      - Daemonic Speed: this model gains the Fights First ability.
      - Enthralling Hypnosis: the triggering unit takes a Leadership test (2D6, passing on its current Leadership or higher); if passed, nothing happens; otherwise, enemy units within 6" of this model cannot Fall Back.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Beguiling Form" id="7876-9d5d-dcd6-ec59" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent's Command phase, until the end of the battle round:
  -&gt; At the start of your opponent's Command phase: each time an attack targets this model, apply -1 to the Hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Daemonic Speed" id="c3e2-1be5-a52f-07b7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent's Command phase, until the end of the battle round:
  -&gt; At the start of your opponent's Command phase: this model gains the Fights First ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Enthralling Hypnosis" id="6803-e720-09e4-b03b" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent's Command phase, until the end of the battle round:
  -&gt; At the start of your opponent's Command phase:
    -&gt; The triggering unit takes a Leadership test (2D6, passing on its current Leadership or higher); if passed, nothing happens; otherwise, enemy units within 6" of this model cannot Fall Back.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Daemonic Poisons" id="74a1-f17d-a395-3ca2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; After this model resolves its attacks during your Shooting phase or after this model resolves its attacks during the Fight phase, for the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit this phase: that unit is poisoned.
-&gt; At the start of the Command phase:
  For each enemy unit that is poisoned that is on the battlefield:
    -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 4+, the unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Supreme Commander" id="3aab-cfc2-1624-10b3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is friendly, the unit must be your Warlord.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="c424-81ed-5c80-7327" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="09de-4e27-ed18-afcf" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="9774-cc0c-65f2-8950" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
