        <profile name="Airborne Predator" id="1b98-bdb0-bf3b-2bd9" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends a Normal move, you may use this ability:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit was moved over by this model during that move:
    -&gt; If the selected unit has the FLY keyword, roll 2 D6: for each 3+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
    -&gt; Unless the selected unit has the FLY keyword, roll 2 D6: for each 4+, that unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Hover" id="5c03-9f83-eca7-0564" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time the unit uses ability, the unit's Takes to the Skies ability has no limit on its range.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="987d-e392-f972-0da8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="afa5-a3e0-e9b8-2376" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
