        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="b627-fcac-1859-dcc3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Revel in Desecration" id="0e52-877d-ce2a-2b54" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Unless the target unit is below half strength, this model gets +1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scuttling Walker" id="8ac9-dfa1-78a6-f881" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move:
  -&gt; The unit can move over non-Titanic models as though they were not there.
  -&gt; The unit can move over terrain features as though they were not there.
  -&gt; The triggering unit is eligible to move even if it is within Engagement Range of enemy units.
  -&gt; The triggering unit cannot end a move within Engagement Range of any enemy unit, during its Normal, Advance and Fall Back moves.
  -&gt; The unit automatically passes Desperate Escape tests.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="1265-41f6-cb03-a0d4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
