            <profile name="Warp Walker" id="415e-55a9-a929-6891" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">-&gt; When the unit ends an Advance move, until the end of the phase: the unit does not make an Advance roll; add 6" to its Move characteristic instead.
-&gt; When the unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move:
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over enemy models as though they were not there.
  -&gt; This model is eligible to move even if it is within Engagement Range of enemy units.
  -&gt; This model cannot end a move within Engagement Range of any enemy unit, during its Normal, Advance and Fall Back moves.
  -&gt; The unit automatically passes Desperate Escape tests.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="35"/>
            <cost name="Enhancements" typeId="f759-1bc4-cb3a-f0d2" value="1"/>
          </costs>
