              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: The unit is eligible to be targeted with the Heroic Intervention Stratagem even if it has already been targeted with that Stratagem this phase.
Reduce the CP cost of that use of the Stratagem by 1CP (to a minimum of 0CP).
The unit's Heroic Intervention ability has no limit on its number of uses, and this use does not count toward that ability's limit for other units.
Applies to: units with EMPEROR’S CHILDREN.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
