              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: Once per turn per model, during the Movement phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one friendly EMPEROR'S CHILDREN TRANSPORT unit that is in Strategic Reserves: that unit can be set up on the battlefield, treating the battle round as 1 higher than it is.
