              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move:
  -&gt; The triggering unit can move over enemy models as though they were not there.
  -&gt; This model is eligible to move even if it is within Engagement Range of enemy units.
  -&gt; This model cannot end a move within Engagement Range of any enemy unit, during its Normal, Advance and Fall Back moves.
  -&gt; The unit automatically passes Desperate Escape tests.
Applies to: units with EMPEROR’S CHILDREN.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="10"/>
